    "description": "Momentous sells unflavored creatine monohydrate at 5 g per scoop in a 90-serving (450 g) jar, NSF Certified for Sport per the brand. Note that Momentous's own FAQ now says it no longer sources from Creapure, although some older listings and reviews still say it does. It was about $42.99 on Amazon when we checked (November 2026), sold by Momentous US; prices move. The brand's own subscription price drops it to about $0.35 a serving.",
    "pros": [
      "NSF Certified for Sport, per the brand",
      "Single-ingredient unflavored creatine, 5 g per scoop",
