    "pros": [
      "About $0.21 per serving in the 1 kg tub, the cheapest here",
      "Single-ingredient unflavored powder",
      "200 servings, so one tub lasts over six months"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "No sport certification; testing is a brand claim",
      "Many flavored Nutricost listings sit alongside it, so check you have the unflavored tub"
